  "basis": "The dashboard chart uses a dual-axis layout with separate blue (left) and red (right) vertical scales and no printed numeric tick labels or 2012 data values. The O/B checks confirm that the condition for comparing vertical marker height across the two series (a common comparable scale) is refuted. Consequently, the visible evidence does not establish which cohort (0-19 or 20-39) had the larger population in 2012. Since the necessary routing condition is unresolved, no public option to open a specific cohort's record is justified.",
